  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The ability to +rep a user on their profile, where their total reputation can be displayed. Also having a setting where you hide users who have a low rep would be good to rid of crashing avatars and generally unpleasant people. Blocking Users could also lower their reputation by 1 point.",
